  "text": "Skip to practice home\nEKKY Studio Architects\nPrepare a conversation ↗\n\nNICOSIA\n\nA clear conversation.\nYour next step.\n\nEKKY Studio Architects · Nicosia\n\n\nPrepare your first conversation ↗\nExplore the practice\nES\nEKKY Studio Architects\nPublished profile\nNicosia\n\nTHE PRACTICE\n\nYour professional.\nYour next conversation.\n\nNicosia architectural practice established in 2009 by Kenzo Yamashita and Elina Kriticou, producing contemporary, sustainability-led high-end residential, hospitality, industrial, commercial and interior design projects.\n\nAbout this information\n\nPUBLISHED AREAS OF WORK\n\nFind your starting point.\n\nExplore a service summary here, then prepare the questions you want to ask.\n\nService details have not been added. Ask about current services directly.\n\nBEFORE THE FIRST CONVERSATION\n\nA little preparation.\nA clearer conversation.\n\nChoose a topic and preferred language. Keep a short checklist of practical questions, without entering case details.\n\nBuild my consultation checklist\n↗\n01\nChoose a starting point\n\nSelect one of the practice’s published areas.\n\n02\nPrepare your questions\n\nAsk about availability, fees, documents and language.\n\n03\nContact the practice\n\nConfirm the next step directly. This checklist makes no appointment.\n\nA REAL CONVERSATION\n\nSpeak with the practice.\n\nEKKY Studio Architects\nErechthiou 3, Egkomi, 2413 Nicosia\n\n+357 22 311924 ↗\ninfo@ekkystudioarchitects.com ↗\n\nCalling and email open your own app. Confirm current arrangements directly with the practice.\n\nCheck private enquiries on Zoi\n\nFOR THE PRACTICE TEAM\n\nYour professional home.\n\nAuthorized workspace members can manage profile information, enquiries and business tools.\n\nOpen workspace tools ↗\n\nAccess is checked in your workspace.\n\nA professional home on Zoi, sourced from the practice’s published information.\nOfficial website ↗\n\nShare this practice ↗",
